WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.480
¿Cuál es la garantía de que

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.720
you won’t get rid of us afterwards?

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.600
You know what?

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.040
You have my word right?

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.360
Veronica, don't listen to him.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.160
His word means nothing.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.080
He even betrayed his own father.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.440
Really?

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.040
Hey, please.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.040
You didn’t like the old man either, no?

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.760
Yeah, I didn’t,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.480
but not enough to hand him over

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.520
to the Feds!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.600
And then our mother died

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.520
in a very mysterious car accident.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:46.640
You’re insane, Greg.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:49.240
You’re fucking insane.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:49.880
I don't know

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.200
what you're talking about.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:51.880
Okay, okay.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.320
Stop all this.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.560
I'm signing it.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.880
I am willing to do this if it

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.600
if it means that he will keep you alive.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.840
Please, no.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.200
Yes.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.040
This is so sweet.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.480
Someone give me a bucket -

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.040
I'm gonna throw up.

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.080
No!
